{
    "title": "Mango: Lector de Manga Espa\u00f1ol",
    "description": "Mango is an application to read all types of comics in Spanish.\r\n\r\nAt Mango you can find all kinds of genres of action, adventure, yaoi, yuri, comedy, boys love and many more.\r\n\r\nAll stories are updated based on the source.\r\n\r\n\u3010Characteristics\u3011\r\n\r\n\u25ba Daily updates:\r\n\r\nAll stories are updated and are in HD quality, the genres that are updated the most are action, horror, yaoi, yuri, gore, comedy, etc.\r\n\r\nNow you can also read popular Korean and Chinese comics.\r\n\r\n\u25ba New releases.\r\n\r\nNew comics and free stories are added daily.\r\n\r\nSave your stories to favorites and keep track of your reading.\r\n\r\nAll Mangas are free, Manhuas and Novels are for premium users.\r\n\r\n\u25ba Quick search engine by demographics such as Sh\u014dnen, Sh\u014djo, Seinen, Josei etc.\r\n\r\n\u25ba Optimized comic reading\r\n\r\nYou can go from horizontal to vertical reading without any problem.\r\n\r\nTip: Most Novels and Manhuas are vertical reading, you can change the reading mode from the settings menu or in the tool icon on the reader.\r\n\r\nMango has arrived!\r\n\r\n\u25ba Disclaimer\r\nMango is an internet image reader provided by comics users and communities, for more information please read our disclaimer:\r\nhttps://mangomanga.co/disclaimer\r\n\r\nFor more information visit our terms and conditions: https://mangomanga.co/terms",
    "descriptionHTML": "Mango is an application to read all types of comics in Spanish.<br><br>At Mango you can find all kinds of genres of action, adventure, yaoi, yuri, comedy, boys love and many more.<br><br>All stories are updated based on the source.<br><br>\u3010Characteristics\u3011<br><br>\u25ba Daily updates:<br><br>All stories are updated and are in HD quality, the genres that are updated the most are action, horror, yaoi, yuri, gore, comedy, etc.<br><br>Now you can also read popular Korean and Chinese comics.<br><br>\u25ba New releases.<br><br>New comics and free stories are added daily.<br><br>Save your stories to favorites and keep track of your reading.<br><br>All Mangas are free, Manhuas and Novels are for premium users.<br><br>\u25ba Quick search engine by demographics such as Sh\u014dnen, Sh\u014djo, Seinen, Josei etc.<br><br>\u25ba Optimized comic reading<br><br>You can go from horizontal to vertical reading without any problem.<br><br>Tip: Most Novels and Manhuas are vertical reading, you can change the reading mode from the settings menu or in the tool icon on the reader.<br><br>Mango has arrived!<br><br>\u25ba Disclaimer<br>Mango is an internet image reader provided by comics users and communities, for more information please read our disclaimer:<br>https://mangomanga.co/disclaimer<br><br>For more information visit our terms and conditions: https://mangomanga.co/terms",
